    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n9 Meathville Terrace is a charming and well-presented two-bedroom home, ideally positioned within a quiet and established residential street off Long Lane. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this inviting property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a conveniently located city base.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall giving access to the living room, a well-appointed kitchen, and two spacious double bedrooms, and a bathroom. The property has been carefully maintained and is ready for immediate occupation, allowing prospective purchasers to move in with ease. To the front, residents benefit from on-street parking, while to the rear there is a private outdoor area which provides a pleasant space for outdoor dining, relaxing, or enjoying a morning coffee.\n\nConveniently located in the heart of Dublin 8 close to a host of local amenities, shops, cafes, restaurants, and excellent transport links, 9 Meathville Terrace offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a comfortable home in a highly accessible and desirable location, only 10 minutes' walk to St. Stephens Green, and a 20 minutes' walk to Trinity College."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nTimber floor, shelving, ceiling coving, , timber panelling, window to dining area.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.93m x 3.90m\nBright dual aspect room featuring ceiling coving and a ceiling rose, feature cast iron open fireplace with fitted and working stove, radiators, fitted alcove presses and shelving, timber flooring and giving access to the kitchen to the rear.\n\nBreakfast Room - 2.21m x 2.51m\nTiled floor, radiator, storage closet and access to the outdoor space.\n\nKitchen - 2.16m x 2.51m\nWell-appointed kitchen, plumbed for washing machine, wall mounted and floor storage, completed with oven/hob.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.47m x 4.00m\nDouble room to front, radiator, feature cast iron fireplace, built-in wardrobes..\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.24m x 2.67m\nDouble room to rear, feature cast iron fireplace, timber floor, built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.25m x 1.65m\nTitled floor, WC, whb and shower/bath.\n\nCity Garden - \nSouth facing city garden located off the kitchen ideal for “al fresco dining”\n\n"
      },
